  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1704.05 Revenue From Other Local Governments.\n\nAccount 3379, “Intergovernmental Revenues - Other,” shall be for revenues from other local governments.\n\nSource. #6335, eff 9-24-96 (from Rev 1706); ss by #8179, eff 9-24-04; ss by #10214, eff 10-24-12; ss by #13489, eff 11-15-22 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 1700)",
